      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAJOR CONFLICT (2) turned in a plain effort last time when seventh at this track over 300m behind Midweek Scotches (17.87) in a Grade 3/4. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. FLYING BLUE MOON (5) finds it hard to win. Finished in the minors latest when third (17.61) at this track and may be close to breaking through. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings five times from eight starts. Will give a great sight again. WHITE EARNER (3) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (18.15) in a Grade 5 at this track. Safe beginner who has drawn to advantage. Expected to give a good account. UNCLE CHICKEN (1) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
